---
layout: base.njk
title: Sponsor Career Opportunities - ACM CAIS 2026
description: Open positions from CAIS 2026 sponsors. Explore career opportunities in AI and agentic systems from leading companies in the field.
permalink: /pages/jobs/
extraStyles: |
  .jobs-hero {
    position: relative;
    background: url('/assets/images/hero ultralight gradient.png') center/cover no-repeat;
    color: var(--eerie-black);
    padding: 4.5rem 0;
  }
  .sponsor-block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
  .sponsor-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--platinum);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .sponsor-header img {
    height: 28px;
    width: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .sponsor-header .tier-badge {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--cais-accent);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .job-card {
    background: var(--seasalt);
    border: 1px solid var(--platinum);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 200ms ease;
  }
  .job-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--cais-accent);
  }
  .job-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .job-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--davys-gray);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .job-card .btn-apply {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cais-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 200ms ease;
  }
  .job-card .btn-apply:hover {
    color: var(--terracotta-medium);
  }
  .anchor { scroll-margin-top: 84px; }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .jobs-hero { padding: 3rem 0; }
  }
---

<header class="jobs-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-3">Career Opportunities</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-0">Open positions from CAIS 2026 sponsors building the future of AI and agentic systems.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5">

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="col-lg-8">

        {% if sponsorJobs.length == 0 %}
        <div class="highlight-box p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-muted mb-0"><i class="bi bi-briefcase me-2"></i>Sponsor job postings will appear here soon.</p>
        </div>
        {% else %}

        {% for sponsor in sponsorJobs %}
        <section id="{{ sponsor.sponsor | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}" class="sponsor-block anchor">
          <div class="sponsor-header">
            <a href="{{ sponsor.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <img src="/assets/images/{{ sponsor.logo }}" alt="{{ sponsor.sponsor }}" loading="lazy" />
            </a>
            <span class="tier-badge">{{ sponsor.tier }} sponsor</span>
          </div>

          {% for job in sponsor.jobs %}
          <div class="job-card">
            <h3>{{ job.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ job.description }}</p>
            <a href="{{ job.applyUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-apply">
              <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i> Apply on {{ sponsor.sponsor }}
            </a>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </section>
        {% endfor %}

        {% endif %}

      </div>

      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <aside>

          <div class="card mb-4" style="border: 2px solid var(--cais-accent); border-radius: 4px;">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-briefcase me-2"></i>About These Listings</h3>
              <p class="small mb-3">These career opportunities are provided by CAIS 2026 sponsors as part of their sponsorship. All positions are in AI, machine learning, and agentic systems.</p>
              <p class="small mb-0 text-muted">Interested in posting jobs here? <a href="/pages/sponsors/">Learn about sponsorship</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          {% if sponsorJobs.length > 1 %}
          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-building me-2"></i>Sponsors Hiring</h3>
              <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                {% for sponsor in sponsorJobs %}
                <li class="mb-2"><a href="#{{ sponsor.sponsor | lower | replace(' ', '-') }}">{{ sponsor.sponsor }}</a> <span class="small text-muted">({{ sponsor.jobs.length }} {{ "position" if sponsor.jobs.length == 1 else "positions" }})</span></li>
                {% endfor %}
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% endif %}

          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3 class="h6 fw-bold mb-3"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-2"></i>Quick Links</h3>
              <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                <li class="mb-2"><a href="/pages/sponsors/">Sponsors</a></li>
                <li class="mb-2"><a href="/pages/registration/">Registration</a></li>
                <li class="mb-2"><a href="/program/2026/">Program</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

        </aside>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
